# graphify corpus exclusions — same syntax as .gitignore, evaluated after it.
# Only ever excludes more; it cannot re-include anything .gitignore drops.

# Local Claude Code config and vendored third-party skill documentation.
# These are tooling, not this project's content — indexing them buries the
# Swift app graph under ~80 files of Apple/Anthropic reference material.
.claude/

# App icon artwork: the same icon rendered at many sizes and tints.
# Vision extraction on these costs one LLM call each and yields no structure.
# Screenshots/ is deliberately NOT excluded — those images document real app UI
# (menu bar dropdown, settings window) and produce useful nodes.
*.icon/
*.xcassets/
Assets/Symbols/
